{"id":"beschreibung","lemma":"Beschreibung","pos":"noun","rank":2950,"glosses":["description"],"ipa":"/bəˈʃʁaɪ̯bʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/De-Beschreibung.ogg/De-Beschreibung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Beschreibung","plural":"Beschreibungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich mag die Beschreibung.","en":"I like that description.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/288266","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Der Mann entspricht der Beschreibung.","en":"The man answers the description.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"to correspond","l":"entsprechen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Beschreibung in der Zeitung passt auf ihn.","en":"He fits the description in the newspaper.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"newspaper"},{"g":"to fit","l":"passen"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"him"}]},{"text":"Ich kenne keinen, auf den diese Beschreibung passt.","en":"I don't know anyone who matches that description.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to fit","l":"passen"}]},{"text":"Wir haben es anhand Ihrer Beschreibung erkannt.","en":"We recognized it from your description.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"by means of, with"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},null,{"g":"to recognize, perceive","l":"erkennen"}]}]}